{"id":"steam-1197170","steam":1197170,"igdb":null,"type":"dlc","title":"Ink Hero DLC","summary":"Ink Hero is a 2D platform jumping type game with the theme of Chinese classical ink painting. The story tells the protagonist's ability to constantly improve himself through battle, thus eliminating many of the ancient Chinese legends.","about":"Introduction to DLC\r\nThe content of DLC is a continuation of the game, including 2 new levels.\r\n\r\nGame introduction\r\nInk Hero is a 2D platform jumping type game with the theme of Chinese classical ink painting. The story tells the protagonist's ability to constantly improve himself through battle, thus eliminating many of the ancient Chinese legends.\r\n\r\nBasic operation of the game\r\nOrdinary attack, skill, jump, climb the wall\r\n\r\nGame Features\r\nNeed to evade enemy attacks by tumbling or skill, which requires a certain speed of response.\r\n\r\nThe beautiful Chinese classical art picture puts you in the mountains and waters.\r\n\r\nElegant Chinese classical music, background music is mostly played by Chinese classical instruments such as guzheng, pipa and erhu.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197170/capsule_616x353.jpg?t=1574125423","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197170/header.jpg?t=1574125423","banner":null,"header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197170/header.jpg?t=1574125423","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197170/ss_41b51f45159d8a117d2bf1b76a877f3a5ce93e08.600x338.jpg?t=1574125423","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197170/ss_41b51f45159d8a117d2bf1b76a877f3a5ce93e08.jpg?t=1574125423"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197170/ss_354e9f8c565ca7302eb86e5c131790d6b0458ac4.600x338.jpg?t=1574125423","full":"https://sh